Subject: [PATCH 6/8] feat(app): silver savings, pledge an item and a bank
 asset desk on a test ledger

Silver in grams and rupees with a proof line, Telugu and English. Pledge a
car, two wheeler, land papers or jewellery set, see the receipt, borrow
against it and pay back. Bank side desk: approved buyers bid, borrower can
pay dues inside the window, settle pays surplus to the borrower. Same rules
and numbers as contracts/src/assets. Test money only.
